01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
Music and Lyrics is a 2007 American musical romantic
comedy-drama film written and directed by Marc Lawrence.

11
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
It focuses on the relationship that evolves between a former pop music idol (of the fictional band
PoP!) and an aspiring writer as they struggle to compose a song for a reigning pop diva.

12
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The film was released on February 14, 2007, by Warner Bros.

13
01:24:30,000 --> 01:24:36,000
It received mixed-to-positive reviews from critics, who praised Grant's performance and the
musical numbers but found the film simplistic, and grossed $145.9 million worldwide.

14
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
The film explores themes of pop star, romcom, has been, songwriting, piano.

15
01:37:30,000 --> 01:37:36,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
